# custom-blocks — шаги записи (что показывается — custom-blocks.md)
# Этап 1 — умолчания; этап 2 начинается заходом в настройки: Add Block и Project в нём.
open Custom blocks.md
caret - call the bank about the card
say Default: a link goes after the text
cmd open-tagwheel-right
key ArrowRight
key ArrowUp
key Enter
expect - call the bank about the card || [[Project A]]

say Add Block → Project into Custom block 1
settings Tags & PKM
click Add Block
click ↓
close
caret - call the bank about the card @ about
say tagWheel Custom block 1 → the link goes at the cursor
cmd open-tagwheel-custom-b1
key ArrowUp
key Enter
expect - call the bank [[Project A]] about the card
say Again on the link → the next Value in its place
cmd open-tagwheel-custom-b1
key ArrowUp
key Enter
expect - call the bank [[Project B]] about the card
